cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Lex, please cite it as below. For the benchmark itself, the dataset card
  (bench/DATASET_CARD.md) gives its citation and licence (CC BY 4.0).
type: software
title: "Lex: an open benchmark for question answering over Portuguese legislation"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark of dated questions on Portuguese labour and tenancy law, each with the
  article versions a correct answer must cite, and an open-source reference system measured
  against it.
authors:
  - family-names: Machado
    given-names: Tiago
version: 0.4.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/timimata/lex"
keywords:
  - legal question answering
  - benchmark
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - Portuguese legislation
